# Company-specific profiles are ISOLATED and never committed to this shared repo.
# General conventions here are shareable (consulting, handoff, a future employer);
# company constraints are not. See companies/_template.md for the rationale.
#
# To hand a client this repo: share the general files + only their own
# companies/<name>/ folder. No company profile references any other company,
# so there is no cross-contamination path.
#
# Note the pattern: `companies/*` excludes the *contents*, not the directory.
# Excluding `companies/` itself would stop git descending into it, and the
# negation below could never re-include anything.
companies/*

# ...except the generic scaffold. It contains no company information and is
# linked from CONVENTIONS_CORE.md and README.md as documentation, so without
# this a fresh clone has broken links.
!companies/_template.md

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
